<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-heading-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color">UX Strategy &amp; Research</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>I know my way around usability, but I’m not a UX strategist. If you’re looking for heat maps, user testing, or engagement analysis, a UX designer or researcher is your person. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Once the plan’s in place, I make sure the build <em>feels right</em> in practice.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

