<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-heading-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color">Accessibility Legal Compliance</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>I care deeply about accessibility and follow WCAG best practices, but I’m not certified to provide legal or compliance audits (e.g., ADA or Section 508).</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If compliance is a formal requirement, I recommend working with an accessibility consultant or auditor.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

