<!-- /wp:heading --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>I write documentation, not taglines. If you need content strategy, keyword optimization, or ad campaigns, you’ll want to bring in a marketing expert.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>I can make your site fast and SEO-friendly — the words and strategy are up to you.</p>
